# --- Generated images ---
# PPMs are ~12 MB each and are reproduced by running the tasks.
# The proj3 source image and instructor reference outputs are the only
# non-regenerable ones, so they are kept (force-added).
*.ppm
!proj3/og_input.ppm
!proj3/answers/*.ppm

